        "original_id": "0255b182-512d-5f57-977f-073a20ab52b9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Liaoyang, Changchun, Liaoning province, T'ai-tzu River, Anshan, China\n- People: Yuan Baojing\n- Topics: Population, geography\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Liaoyang and Anshan formed a metropolitan area with 2,057,200 inhabitants.\n- In 2010, Changchun had a total population of 7,674,439 under its jurisdiction, according to the China census.\n- Liaoyang is a prefecture-level city in east-central Liaoning province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Liaoyang is situated on the T'ai-tzu River.\n- Yuan Baojing was born on 16 February 1966 and died on 17 March 2006.\n- Yuan Baojing was a Chinese billionaire from Liaoyang, Liaoning province.",
